; Continuation of an item handler: RET into the item's action
;
; #R$A600 and #R$A822 load IX with this address before the overlap test #R$A85F, which ends with JP (IX). The RET pops
; the next word of the slot (+4), the item's action routine, and enters it with the carry flag from the test (set when
; Jean overlaps the item) and SP at slot + 6.
@label=ItemActionEntry
c$A614 RET           ;
